  triage:description "fenix critical design review, PR #1438 comment https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1438#issuecomment-5648340494 (2026-09-12T20:01:44Z), reviewed at b06b3e262. crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake/tests/mod.rs:1169-1170,1196 (ac01: AX5-AC1-FIRST/SECOND identity assertions replaced by len() > 0 / len() > before), and :1394 (ax5_03: positive AX5-ASSIGNED-2 assertion dropped). ax5_01 (:1119-1121) shows the correct re-pin pattern (P14 shape: starts with <atm from=\", no task id) that the weakened tests should have followed instead." ;
